      "category": "LDLT",
      "signature": "adjoint(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "LDLT*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "LDLT&",
      "docs": "\\returns the adjoint of \\c *this, that is, a const reference to the decomposition itself as the underlying matrix is self-adjoint.\nThis method is provided for compatibility with other matrix decompositions, thus enabling generic code such as:\n\\code x = decomposition.adjoint().solve(b) \\endcode"
